},{"title":"Un addio a questo stile di vita lussuoso!","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17431","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"136804","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49458","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65844","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303867","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"80997","synopsis":"Chris tells Kazuma that the necklace he and Iris swapped bodies with is a sacred treasure, and it is dangerous and can threaten lives depending on its use. Princess Iris is in danger! Two robbers dressed in black sneak into the royal castle at night!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a4fdVIXtgt4OFaxlTZ48aqEJj64.jpg"},{"title":"Riposo per questo avventuriero emergente!","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17431","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"136804","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49458","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"65844","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"303867","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"81182","synopsis":"Kazuma and his friends return to Axel and receive 300 million eris as a reward for subjugating Sylvia, an executive of the Devil King's army. Kazuma and Aqua go to high-end restaurants, and Aqua enjoys her long-awaited life as a celebrity.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1cicdwcTUTdJGtSdofZ0X5Jhw87.jpg"},{"title":"Un eterno riposo per il padrone di questo lago!","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17431","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"136804","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49458","episodeNumbers":[8